    <body>
      <div type="work" n="166">
        <pb n="214"/>
        <head>Another.</head>
        <head>166 — ii — VI. — <quote>Truth hath sprung out of the earth</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">When thou, God the heavenly Word, in thy mercy becamest man for our sake and didst walk and go to and fro upon the earth, we saw heaven opened as it is written, and spiritual hosts of bodiless angels ascending<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> and descending<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/>, and serving thee with fear as God; and after the Cross and the completion of the saving dispensation we saw earth after the pattern of heaven sending upwards like angels men who made themselves illustrious [by endurance and gained the victory and were<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> perfected through the combat of martyrdom<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> : by whose<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> prayers, <persName>our Saviour</persName>, have mercy upon us, thou who didst unite and join earthly things to heavenly.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 214, n. 1</orig></choice> Ps. lxxxv, 12 LXX.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 214, n. 2</orig></choice> Corr. representing <foreign xml:lang="grc">δή</foreign> (?) following.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 214, n. 3</orig></choice> John i, 49-51 <quote><persName>Nathaniel</persName>..... to him, <quote>Our master, thou..... than these</quote>. <persName>Jesus</persName> saith..... <quote>Son of man</quote></quote> (verbal diff.).</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 214, n. 4</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>through suffering are</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 214, n. 5</orig></choice> Unintelligible corr.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 214, n. 6</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>their</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
